&lt;p&gt;Artwork/Illustrations © 2019-2026 Benjamin Fernandez, All rights reserved.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The author of the website and its content wants to acknowledge that all visuals including the characters, assets, and of course all of the projects that are showcased here is created by a real human being, not with AI-generative tools as every project displays the Not By AI badge with the exception of some content that is displayed here on the site.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/homepage/notbyai_created.webp&#34; alt=&#34;Not By AI&#34;  loading=&#34;lazy&#34; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
